            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A female receptacle terminal (10) for an electrical connector is disclosed. The female receptacle terminal includes a receptacle having an opening (20) to receive a male blade terminal (300) in an insertion direction (M). A resilient contact beam (100) extends from a top part of the receptacle towards an opposed bottom part. A contact surface (113) is provided on the bottom part. The contact surface has a contact bump (115) which is curved in both the insertion direction and a width direction, and a guide portion (111) including a ramp with a rear end adjacent to the contact bump and a front end which is linear in the width direction and parallel to the bottom part to engage the male blade terminal at a linear contact interface. Also disclosed is a male blade terminal, an electrical connector and a method of forming an electrical connection.</p>
            </abstract>
